# Read by BuildKit as the ignore file for apps/api/Dockerfile even though the build
# context is the repo root (docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile -t cortex-api .).
# A file at apps/api/.dockerignore is NOT read in that configuration -- verified
# locally -- so this file is the one that actually keeps secrets and local
# node_modules out of the build context. See the comment at the top of Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.env
**/.env.local
.git
supabase/.temp
.superpowers
.claude/worktrees
